    "description": "Alfco NY\nNautical Fisherman with Pipe\nHand Painted Composition / Resin\n14.25\" H x 5.5\" W x 5.5\" L\nUnsigned (Stamped on base)\nThis vintage figurine by Alfco NY depicts a classic maritime character, a sea-weathered fisherman clad in a traditional yellow-orange slicker and sou'wester hat while smoking a pipe. The piece is crafted from a durable composition resin designed to emulate the texture and weight of a hand-carved wood sculpture, featuring deep, expressive graining and a warm, aged patina. The character's jovial expression and detailed attire make it a quintessential piece of mid-to-late 20th-century nautical decor.\nAuthentically marked with the \" ALFCO-NY\" stamp on the rear of the base\nDetailed hand-painted finish highlights the weathered textures of the rain gear and facial features\nSubstantial 2.2-pound weight provides stability for display on shelves or mantels\nCondition:\nGood vintage condition. There is a prominent chip and material loss on the top of the hat as shown in photos. The remainder of the figure shows light surface wear and minor scuffing consistent with age. The base is stable and features a circular opening as manufactured.",
